@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260715-30zng6 — M1 runtime lifecycle
hide empty description
left to right direction

state Idle #EFEFEF
state LoadingConfiguration #FFF2CC
state AuthenticatingSSH #FFF2CC
state PreparingConsumers #FFF2CC
state ApplyingSettings #FCE5CD
state ActivatingPacketReads #FCE5CD
state UsableTCPDNS #D9EAD3
state Stopping #D9D9D9
state Failed #F4CCCC

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> LoadingConfiguration : accepted start / generation += 1
LoadingConfiguration --> AuthenticatingSSH : valid versioned non-secret snapshot
AuthenticatingSSH --> PreparingConsumers : verified host + authenticated session + actual endpoint
PreparingConsumers --> ApplyingSettings : TCP + DNS ready + packet preflight valid\n[no descriptor, HEV, listener or PacketFlow read]
ApplyingSettings --> ActivatingPacketReads : settings apply committed
ActivatingPacketReads --> UsableTCPDNS : read registered + all mandatory health ready\n/ publish TCP=true, safeDNS=true, UDP=false

LoadingConfiguration --> Stopping : cancel or failure
AuthenticatingSSH --> Stopping : cancel or failure
PreparingConsumers --> Stopping : cancel or failure
ApplyingSettings --> Stopping : cancel/failure; clear if commit uncertain
ActivatingPacketReads --> Stopping : cancel/failure; stop reads then clear
UsableTCPDNS --> Stopping : stop or mandatory health loss

Stopping --> Idle : ordinary stop + clear not required/confirmed\n[resources baseline, routes false]
Stopping --> Failed : startup/runtime failure or clear failed/uncertain\n[capabilities false; route fields truthful]
Failed --> Idle : adapter releases failed generation

Idle --> Idle : stop / idempotent no-op
Stopping --> Stopping : repeated stop / join one cleanup task

note bottom of LoadingConfiguration
  Routes forbidden while configuration,
  M0 binding permit, trust/authentication,
  TCP/DNS/packet preparation or route plan
  is invalid, absent, cancelled or stale.
end note

note bottom of ApplyingSettings
  Routes may commit here but capabilities
  remain false until packet reads activate.
end note

note bottom of Failed
  routesInstalled is false when clear was
  not required or was confirmed. Only a
  required failed/uncertain clear publishes
  true + routeState=clearFailed.
end note

note bottom of UsableTCPDNS
  M1 has no ConnectedFull, reasserting,
  UDP, lane scheduling or reconnect state.
end note
@enduml
